  <section id="status" class="doc-section">
    <h2>Status</h2>
    <p>
      WP0 on the task board is <strong>in progress</strong> (adding <code>LocalKeyValue</code> for
      persistent AI context and preferences). Owner directory: <code>packages/db</code>. Spec:
      <code>specs/02-database.md</code>. Package name: <code>@cadcamfun/db</code>.
    </p>
    <DocCallout type="note" title="LocalKeyValue is the open increment">
      <p>
        Spec 02 §4 describes <code>LocalKeyValue</code> for JSON-compatible local state
        (<code>ai.context.*</code>, <code>ai.memory.*</code>, UI preferences). The sidecar
        <code>KvStore</code> is the only repository that writes it, through the shared
        <code>Database</code> service. AI provider credentials stay in the owner-only credentials
        file and must never be stored in this table.
      </p>
    </DocCallout>
  </section>

