      Generated folders currently under <code>packages/db/drizzle/</code> include
      <code>20261004223029_careful_monster_badoon</code>,
      <code>20261008030518_redundant_dagger</code>,
      <code>20261009012351_moaning_loki</code>, and
      <code>20261009171602_brown_mad_thinker</code>. A new change adds another folder via
      <code>bun run db:generate</code>.
    </p>
